  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Supernatural Arts Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Chrollo%27s_Bandit_Secret_Book_Hunter_X_Hunter.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180527001139\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Chrollo-using-bandit-secret-book\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Chrollo%27s_Bandit_Secret_Book_Hunter_X_Hunter.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180527001139\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Chrollo%27s_Bandit_Secret_Book_Hunter_X_Hunter.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180527001139 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Chrollo%27s_Bandit_Secret_Book_Hunter_X_Hunter.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180527001139 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Chrollo-using-bandit-secret-book\" width=\"266\" height=\"148\" data-image-key=\"Chrollo-using-bandit-secret-book.gif\" data-image-name=\"Chrollo-using-bandit-secret-book.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Chrollo Lucifer's (Hunter x Hunter) Bandit Secret technique allows him to steal the <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Arts\" title=\"Aura Arts\">Nen techniques</a> of other people to use them for his own.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal supernatural arts.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Is that...all you can do with that wonderful Gift? In that case, give it to me!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Ihwa/Hero Killer (Hero Killer)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>steal <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts\" title=\"Supernatural Arts\">supernatural arts</a> from others</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Manipulation\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Manipulation\">Supernatural Arts Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Theft\" title=\"Talent Theft\">Talent Theft</a>. Opposite of <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Bestowal\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Bestowal\">Supernatural Arts Bestowal</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Literature\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Literature</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Cartoons\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cartoons</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Supernatural Arts/Skills/Techniques Absorption/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal the <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts\" title=\"Supernatural Arts\">supernatural arts</a> of another person. In some cases, the user gains those arts for themselves while in other cases they simply remove the arts from someone else.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Imprinting\" title=\"Ability Imprinting\">Ability Imprinting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Post-Mortem_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Post-Mortem Power Absorption\">Post-Mortem Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Erasure\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Erasure\">Supernatural Arts Erasure</a> - by stealing one's arts</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Replication\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Replication\">Supernatural Arts Replication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Manipulation\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Manipulation\">Supernatural Arts Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Theft\" title=\"Talent Theft\">Talent Theft</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Anchoring\" title=\"Knowledge Anchoring\">Knowledge Anchoring</a></li>\n<li>May only be temporary.</li>\n<li>May only be able to take a specific type of arts.</li>\n<li>User may not have the physical, mental or emotional capabilities to put their stolen arts to use.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Bestowal\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Bestowal\">Supernatural Arts Bestowal</a> can return or give new arts.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FAeni.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSupernatural_Arts_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-e